[00:00.67]1. Praise Jehovah, God of peace,
[00:07.67]God of unity.
[00:12.86]He will make all wars to cease,
[00:19.00]Bring in harmony.
[00:25.15]Prince of Peace is Christ his Son,
[00:31.29]Tender, calm, and kind.
[00:37.44]When the fight for right he’s won,
[00:46.12]Perfect peace we’ll find.
[00:54.81]2. We have left off angry words,
[01:00.48]Making quarrels cease.
[01:06.14]We have made from spears and swords,
[01:17.82]Implements of peace.
[01:23.26]If this peace we want to keep,
[01:24.91]Then we must forgive.
[01:29.45]Peacefully as Jesus’ sheep,
[01:35.35]May we learn and live.
[01:43.96]3. Peace from God gives proof to all;
[01:49.46]He has blessed our way.
[01:55.50]His commands we gladly keep,
[02:01.54]Ready to obey.
[02:07.58]We would recommend our way,
[02:13.15]Show our peaceful care
[02:19.05]Till the Kingdom’s perfect day
[02:30.33]Brings peace ev’rywhere.